(text "ONE USB-C: J1 VBUS / CC / USB_GND feed this primary-side sheet; D+/D- go through U18." (at 20 18 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid a4a829fc-0e02-4d0a-adb8-15f160cb9a47))
(text "No primary USB_GND connection to board GND. Only U18 and U6 cross the isolation boundary. Prototype: not for fabrication or fencer use." (at 20 27 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 1138b055-072b-4e7b-adcb-606ffb9751d4))
(text "U5 NVM: PDO1 5V/0.5A; PDO2 20V/3A; 2 PDOs; POWER_OK_CFG=10b; USB_COMM_CAPABLE=1; REQ_SRC_CURRENT=0.\nProgram/read back before full-system bring-up. Laptop-only SKU: PDO1-only profile, application branch stays off.\nJ12: external 3.3V programmer pull-ups on SDA/SCL; no board-rail connection. VREG pins are decoupling only." (at 25 175 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 134adb95-7ab3-49d9-a037-c551979dec71))
(text "U19: LTC3130-1 fixed 5V buck-boost; MODE low selects automatic Burst/PWM.\nVS1=GND, VS2=VCC; 1uF VIN Kelvin bypass and 22nF bootstraps.\nU21 controls acquisition/application power; U18 remains LTM2884. Fixed-5V primary supply; no external compensation network." (at 230 205 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 534994e4-b10f-42fc-b200-87789d3957a4))
(text "Q4/Q5 clamp EN unless both PDO2 and VBUS-path flags assert low.\nSeparate detach flag prevents stale POWER_OK2 keeping the branch on.\n20V contract does not distinguish a laptop from a charger." (at 25 345 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 76f46aad-89b4-4faa-b4d0-1a6ffc808099))
(text "U20: nominal 18.0V UVLO / 21.84V OVLO; 2.43A limit. ITIMER NC for fastest response.\n10nF dVdt gives approximately 100ms rise at 20V. Verify startup under actual converter load." (at 230 345 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 745b8757-b2a5-4993-a2c4-673e4fac5f31))
(text "U6: isolated 9-36V input to 5V/6A maximum module rating, not a validated board load rating. CTRL open enables; TRIM open selects nominal 5V.\nKeep primary/secondary copper separate on every layer. PD negotiation, current budget, thermal behavior, isolation and firmware mode handling remain unverified." (at 25 385 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid cdeb45ba-a85a-4297-8ab9-85c361ac364f))
(text "U21 controls power only; primary USB_GND domain, 6MHz internal clock.\nReset defaults: U18 OFF, suspend shutdown enabled, Q6 inhibits application power.\nJ14 is primary-side service access: do not connect a grounded debugger to the isolated side.\nFirmware and STUSB4500 NVM provisioning are required before operation." (at 45.72 342.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid f3b3d217-0652-4727-aef7-007ab319fd7e))
(global_label "USB_CC1" (shape bidirectional) (at 69.85 74.93 180) (effects (font (size .9 .9)) (justify right)) (uuid 40082a2a-64b8-4fc8-872c-9e83f0331f0e) (property "Intersheetrefs" "" (at 69.85 74.93 180) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (hide yes))))
